{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}
{% block title %}Mortgage Loan: Current Rates and Free Simulation{% endblock %}
{% block meta_description %}
      Compare mortgage loan offers. Competitive rates around 3%, quick simulation and personalized support.
{% endblock %}
{% block meta_keywords %}mortgage loan{% endblock %}
{% block body %}
     <main class="professional-loan">
     <section class="hero-section hero-immobilier text-white d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center text-center">
    <div class="container" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000">
        <h1 class="display-3 fw-bold">Mortgage Loan</h1>
        <p class="lead mt-3">Make your property dream come true. We find the best mortgage loan tailored to your project.</p>
        <a href="#details" class="btn btn-primary-custom btn-lg mt-4">Learn more</a>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="introduction" class="py-5 bg-light-blue">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-lg-10 col-md-12 text-center" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000">
                <h2 class="section-title text-primary-dark mb-4">Understanding Mortgage Loans</h2>
                <p class="lead text-secondary-dark">
                    Acquiring a property, whether it is your primary residence, a rental investment, or land, often represents one of the most important projects in life. To make this dream come true, appropriate <strong>financing</strong> is key. At <strong>{{NAME_SITE}}</strong>, we put our expertise at your service to help you navigate the complex world of <strong>mortgage loans</strong>, offering personalized solutions that perfectly match your situation and property goals.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<section id="details" class="py-5 bg-white">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row mb-5" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000" data-aos-delay="200">
            <div class="col-lg-10 col-md-12 mx-auto">
                <h2 class="section-title text-primary-dark mb-4 text-center">Our Approach to Mortgage Loans</h2>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row align-items-center mb-5 feature-row" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-duration="1000">
            <div class="col-md-6 order-md-2" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-duration="1000">
                <div class="ratio ratio-16x9 video-container shadow-sm rounded">
                    <video loading="lazy" autoplay muted loop playsinline  preload="metadata"
                           poster="{{asset('img/img17.jpg')}}"
                           class="w-100 h-100 object-fit-cover">
                        <source src="{{asset('video/video12.mp4')}}" type="video/mp4">
                        Your browser does not support the video tag.
                    </video>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 order-md-1">
                <h3 class="feature-title text-accent-red mb-3">What exactly is a Mortgage Loan?</h3>
                <p class="text-secondary-dark">
                    A <strong>Mortgage Loan</strong> is a loan intended to finance the purchase, construction, or renovation of real estate (house, apartment, land). It is generally characterized by significant amounts and long repayment periods. This type of loan comes with specific conditions (interest rate, guarantees, borrower's insurance) that must be adapted to your financial profile and the nature of your project to ensure its viability and your peace of mind.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row align-items-center mb-5 feature-row" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-duration="1000">
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="ratio ratio-16x9 video-container shadow-sm rounded">
                    <video loading="lazy" autoplay muted loop playsinline  preload="metadata"
                           poster="{{asset('img/img18.jpg')}}"
                           class="w-100 h-100 object-fit-cover">
                        <source src="{{asset('video/video13.mp4')}}" type="video/mp4">
                        Your browser does not support the video tag.
                    </video>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <h3 class="feature-title text-accent-red mb-3">Why choose {{NAME_SITE}} for your Mortgage Loan?</h3>
                <p class="text-secondary-dark">
                    Obtaining a mortgage loan is a major step. At <span class="fw-bold">{{NAME_SITE}}</span>, we offer you:
                </p>
                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-primary-dark me-2"></i> **Personalized Advice:** Dedicated experts to analyze your situation and needs.</li>
                    <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-primary-dark me-2"></i> **Best Conditions:** Search for the most advantageous rates and guarantees for your project.</li>
                    <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-primary-dark me-2"></i> **Comprehensive Support:** From simulation to signing, we are by your side.</li>
                    <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-primary-dark me-2"></i> **Simplified Procedures:** Streamlined process to save you time and energy.</li>
                    <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-primary-dark me-2"></i> **Transparency:** Clear and complete information on all aspects of your loan.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row mb-5" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000">
            <div class="col-lg-10 mx-auto text-center">
                <h3 class="feature-title text-accent-red mb-4">Who is this service for?</h3>
                <div class="row g-4 justify-content-center">
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0 bg-light-blue">
                            <div class="card-body text-center">
                                <i class="fas fa-home fa-3x text-primary-dark mb-3"></i>
                                <h5 class="card-title text-primary-dark">First-Time Buyers</h5>
                                <p class="card-text text-secondary-dark">For the purchase of your primary residence.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0 bg-light-blue">
                            <div class="card-body text-center">
                                <i class="fas fa-city fa-3x text-primary-dark mb-3"></i>
                                <h5 class="card-title text-primary-dark">Rental Investors</h5>
                                <p class="card-text text-secondary-dark">Financing properties for rent.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0 bg-light-blue">
                            <div class="card-body text-center">
                                <i class="fas fa-wrench fa-3x text-primary-dark mb-3"></i>
                                <h5 class="card-title text-primary-dark">Renovation Projects</h5>
                                <p class="card-text text-secondary-dark">Improve or expand your property.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row mb-5" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000">
            <div class="col-lg-10 mx-auto text-center">
                <h3 class="feature-title text-accent-red mb-4">How does it work? (Simplified Process)</h3>
                <div class="process-steps">
                    <div class="process-step" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-duration="800" data-aos-delay="100">
                        <div class="step-icon bg-primary-dark text-white"><i class="fas fa-1"></i></div>
                        <h5 class="step-title text-primary-dark">Project Definition</h5>
                        <p class="text-secondary-dark">Analysis of your purchase or construction project.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="process-step" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-duration="800" data-aos-delay="200">
                        <div class="step-icon bg-primary-dark text-white"><i class="fas fa-2"></i></div>
                        <h5 class="step-title text-primary-dark">Feasibility Study</h5>
                        <p class="text-secondary-dark">Evaluation of your borrowing capacity and profile.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="process-step" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-duration="800" data-aos-delay="300">
                        <div class="step-icon bg-primary-dark text-white"><i class="fas fa-3"></i></div>
                        <h5 class="step-title text-primary-dark">Offer Search</h5>
                        <p class="text-secondary-dark">Selection of the best proposals from our partners.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="process-step" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-duration="800" data-aos-delay="400">
                        <div class="step-icon bg-primary-dark text-white"><i class="fas fa-4"></i></div>
                        <h5 class="step-title text-primary-dark">File Preparation</h5>
                        <p class="text-secondary-dark">Assistance with compiling and submitting your application.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="process-step" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-duration="800" data-aos-delay="500">
                        <div class="step-icon bg-primary-dark text-white"><i class="fas fa-5"></i></div>
                        <h5 class="step-title text-primary-dark">Signing and Realization</h5>
                        <p class="text-secondary-dark">Support until the signing of the deed.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000">
            <div class="col-lg-10 mx-auto">
                <h3 class="feature-title text-accent-red mb-4 text-center">The benefits for you:</h3>
                <div class="row g-4">
                    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0 bg-primary-dark text-white text-center p-3">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <i class="fas fa-hand-holding-usd fa-2x mb-3 text-accent-red"></i>
                                <h5 class="card-title">Optimal Conditions</h5>
                                <p class="card-text">Access the most competitive rates on the market and the best guarantees.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0 bg-light-blue text-primary-dark text-center p-3">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <i class="fas fa-clipboard-check fa-2x mb-3 text-accent-red"></i>
                                <h5 class="card-title">Solid Application</h5>
                                <p class="card-text">Benefit from our expertise for an impeccable loan application.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0 bg-primary-dark text-white text-center p-3">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <i class="fas fa-hourglass-half fa-2x mb-3 text-accent-red"></i>
                                <h5 class="card-title">Time Savings</h5>
                                <p class="card-text">We manage complex procedures; you focus on your real estate project.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0 bg-light-blue text-primary-dark text-center p-3">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <i class="fas fa-comments-dollar fa-2x mb-3 text-accent-red"></i>
                                <h5 class="card-title">Independent Advice</h5>
                                <p class="card-text">Benefit from objective advice for an informed financing choice.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0 bg-primary-dark text-white text-center p-3">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <i class="fas fa-lock fa-2x mb-3 text-accent-red"></i>
                                <h5 class="card-title">Assured Serenity</h5>
                                <p class="card-text">Realize your project with full confidence, with a secure financial plan.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<section class="cta-section bg-white text-center py-5">
    <div class="container" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-duration="1000">
        <h2 class="fs-2 fw-bold text-primary-dark">Ready to make your real estate dream come true?</h2>
        <p class="lead mt-3 text-secondary-dark">Contact us today for a free, personalized evaluation of your project.</p>
        <a href="{{ path('loan.application.credit') }}" class="btn btn-secondary-custom btn-lg mt-4">Simulate my mortgage loan</a>
    </div>
</section>
     </main>
{% endblock %}